<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20426" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόστρῠχ-ος</span></b> , ὁ,
		heterocl. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόστρυχα</span> in <i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			5.259
		</span></i> (Paul. Sil.), <i><span class="en">
			6.71
		</span></i> (Id.): acc. pl. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόστρυχας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dionys.
					<u>Av.</u>
					2.7
				</span></i>
			:—<i>curl, lock of hair</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				178
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				536
			</span></i>, etc.: in sg. collectively, <i>hair</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπέτασον β. ὤμοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					202
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> poet.,
				<i>anything twisted</i> or <i>wreathed</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρὸς ἀμφήκης β.</span>
			<i>thunderbolt</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1044
			</span></i>: in pl., <i>tendrils</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				3.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>ornament</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς
			ἠπείρου</span>, of Smyrna, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				18(20).9
			</span></i>; of Nicomedia, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				61.12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑστίας χρυσοῦς β.</span>, of a
			son, <i><span class="en">
				Him.
				<u>Or.</u>
				23.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>winged insect</i>, perh.<i>male of the glow-worm</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				551b26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in pl.,
				<i>sea-wecd</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dionys.
				<u>Av.</u>
			</span></i> l.c.</div>
